# Conway's Game of Life (the pack is packs/life) on a drawn soup of 96 x 72
# cells, about a third alive, with rock round it, which stays dead. The board
# spans four chunks (x = 64 and y = 64 are chunk borders), so neighbours are
# counted across them. The test at the end holds the pack to a plain Life.
#
#   make run ARGS="scenario scenarios/tests/life_soup.scenario"
#   make run ARGS="play saves/soup --scenario scenarios/tests/life_soup.scenario"   # to watch it
rules ../../packs/life
seed 1
outside rock
